(3033887, 427203, 68426, '<td valign="top">Very nice looking textile and the composition/presentation of the photo is good - it would be better without the incomplete spots at the top though, I think.</td>', 'Very nice looking textile and the composition/presentation of the photo is good - it would be better without the incomplete spots at the top though, I think.', '2006-11-15 10:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
