(3034390, 425102, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good find with that leaf.  Nice choice for ''Spots'' overall I think.  This photo seems kind of pale, like it needs some contrast and the black points brought up, or check the histogram and/or levels for a basic adjustment.  A little added color saturation might also help some.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good find with that leaf.  Nice choice for ''Spots'' overall I think.  This photo seems kind of pale, like it needs some contrast and the black points brought up, or check the histogram and/or levels for a basic adjustment.  A little added color saturation might also help some.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-15 13:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
