(3035427, 425618, 65234, '<td valign="top">Oh, now that''s really clever!!  I love the perspective on the spotted paper and the *one* spot whited-out (is that a word?).  Like it a lot :-)</td>', 'Oh, now that''s really clever!!  I love the perspective on the spotted paper and the *one* spot whited-out (is that a word?).  Like it a lot :-)', '2006-11-15 18:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
