(3037342, 427404, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what this is.  Is the primary subject of this photo the fuzzy item located in the top left third intersection?  The spots are where?  Not trying to be rude, just trying to understand what this photo is about.  If the primary subject is the item mentioned, then it should be sharper.  A slight boost in saturation would bring out the color more, and a minor adjustment in contrast might help as well.  It''s certainly an interesting item - whatever it is.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what this is.  Is the primary subject of this photo the fuzzy item located in the top left third intersection?  The spots are where?  Not trying to be rude, just trying to understand what this photo is about.  If the primary subject is the item mentioned, then it should be sharper.  A slight boost in saturation would bring out the color more, and a minor adjustment in contrast might help as well.  It''s certainly an interesting item - whatever it is.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-16 10:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3037347, 427220, 30049, '<td valign="top">Sharp, well exposed, and funny.  The things we do for a photo, eh?  :D  Good luck!</td>', 'Sharp, well exposed, and funny.  The things we do for a photo, eh?  :D  Good luck!', '2006-11-16 10:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
