(3038004, 427425, 40718, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, but either too dark or not dark enough.  We see things in the side and background and our eye stops to try to figure out what they are.  This, IMO, detracts from the point of your picture, to see the neatly lit spots.  The biggest example is the pepper shaker in the background.  That should have been removed. 5</td>', 'Creative idea, but either too dark or not dark enough.  We see things in the side and background and our eye stops to try to figure out what they are.  This, IMO, detracts from the point of your picture, to see the neatly lit spots.  The biggest example is the pepper shaker in the background.  That should have been removed. 5', '2006-11-16 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3038006, 427460, 40718, '<td valign="top">Too dark.  Nice composition though.  Shame about the bars (in a number of ways). 5</td>', 'Too dark.  Nice composition though.  Shame about the bars (in a number of ways). 5', '2006-11-16 14:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3038009, 425744, 67301, '<td valign="top">this is a really good shot and lovely that you have got that beautiful tail within the crop. It is a great shame that the belly is so bleached as it is the first thing you see = 7 sorry</td>', 'this is a really good shot and lovely that you have got that beautiful tail within the crop. It is a great shame that the belly is so bleached as it is the first thing you see = 7 sorry', '2006-11-16 14:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3038010, 427523, 40718, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  I particularly like the "shadow: cast by the handle.  I''m not sure if this is a trick with a LCD or whether you actually used voluminous light. 7</td>', 'Neat idea.  I particularly like the "shadow: cast by the handle.  I''m not sure if this is a trick with a LCD or whether you actually used voluminous light. 7', '2006-11-16 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
