(3039623, 427113, 30049, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell you how many of those leaves I''ve seen around here, and not once have I thought that it was "heart" shaped.  Guess I didn''t look hard enough.  Neat idea for the challenge.  I wondering if the image may be a bit too busy to create major viewer impact (higher score).  The background is distracting I think.  Sorry for "thinking" out loud...just trying to figure out why this photo seems kind of "ok" and how it could move to the next level.  Wish I could be more helpful.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I can''t tell you how many of those leaves I''ve seen around here, and not once have I thought that it was "heart" shaped.  Guess I didn''t look hard enough.  Neat idea for the challenge.  I wondering if the image may be a bit too busy to create major viewer impact (higher score).  The background is distracting I think.  Sorry for "thinking" out loud...just trying to figure out why this photo seems kind of "ok" and how it could move to the next level.  Wish I could be more helpful.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 08:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
