(3039807, 426624, 30049, '<td valign="top">Two initial reactions.  1st is way cool, 2nd is way oversharpened.  The oversharpening is really hampering the potential of this photo IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Two initial reactions.  1st is way cool, 2nd is way oversharpened.  The oversharpening is really hampering the potential of this photo IMO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 09:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
