(3039810, 427029, 67152, '<td valign="top">i like the use of expression for this challenge - but the focus throughout the image seems to soft to me</td>', 'i like the use of expression for this challenge - but the focus throughout the image seems to soft to me', '2006-11-17 09:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039812, 426852, 67152, '<td valign="top">the flash is too intense and makes the image suffer</td>', 'the flash is too intense and makes the image suffer', '2006-11-17 09:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039825, 427381, 30049, '<td valign="top">It''s "ok".  Feels a little disconnected as a storyline.  I think it''s the expression on his face, the frazzled hair, and the sweat.  He looks tired - perhaps you meant it to come across this way.  Maybe it''s the color of the "spots"?  Hard to explain, but the image feels drab and depressing.  Maybe a brighter color choice for the spots, like royal blue or something?  I don''t know.  Sorry, wish I could explain it better.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s "ok".  Feels a little disconnected as a storyline.  I think it''s the expression on his face, the frazzled hair, and the sweat.  He looks tired - perhaps you meant it to come across this way.  Maybe it''s the color of the "spots"?  Hard to explain, but the image feels drab and depressing.  Maybe a brighter color choice for the spots, like royal blue or something?  I don''t know.  Sorry, wish I could explain it better.  Anyway, best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 09:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039827, 427304, 30049, '<td valign="top">Where''s the color?  Where''s the contrast?  Oh...you meant to do it this way.  :D  It''s interesting.  Not sure that I like it that much.  Certainly is artistic and you''ve used some OOB thinking in your approach.  As with all art, some like it and others, well...  Kudos for being creative and taking a chance.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Where''s the color?  Where''s the contrast?  Oh...you meant to do it this way.  :D  It''s interesting.  Not sure that I like it that much.  Certainly is artistic and you''ve used some OOB thinking in your approach.  As with all art, some like it and others, well...  Kudos for being creative and taking a chance.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 09:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039834, 427129, 30049, '<td valign="top">Which one is your favorite, the freckle on the shoulder, or the spots on the stuffed toy?  :D  Wait, maybe you mean HER favorite spot?  Hmmm...  Anyway, it''s fun to look at from a man''s POV.  Kind of wish she was a little more sharply focused around the face and eyes.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Which one is your favorite, the freckle on the shoulder, or the spots on the stuffed toy?  :D  Wait, maybe you mean HER favorite spot?  Hmmm...  Anyway, it''s fun to look at from a man''s POV.  Kind of wish she was a little more sharply focused around the face and eyes.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 09:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039842, 426935, 30049, '<td valign="top">Kind of morbid title and theme.  :(  As for the image, I like the idea of using the Twister game as a body wrap.  The background is too busy and distracting.  Almost would have worked better with some lush green grass or plain beige carpet.  Of course then you may have had to come up with a different title.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Kind of morbid title and theme.  :(  As for the image, I like the idea of using the Twister game as a body wrap.  The background is too busy and distracting.  Almost would have worked better with some lush green grass or plain beige carpet.  Of course then you may have had to come up with a different title.  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 09:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039847, 426952, 30049, '<td valign="top">Some interesting refraction going on here in this abstract photo.  Would have a little better impact if the area around the spots (the off-white/grey area) came across somewhat cleaner.  I''d have been tempted to run this thru some very heavy NI and despeckle filters to see if it cleaned up a little more.  All JMO of course.  Clever entry.  Good luck.</td>', 'Some interesting refraction going on here in this abstract photo.  Would have a little better impact if the area around the spots (the off-white/grey area) came across somewhat cleaner.  I''d have been tempted to run this thru some very heavy NI and despeckle filters to see if it cleaned up a little more.  All JMO of course.  Clever entry.  Good luck.', '2006-11-17 09:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039884, 427575, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wow.  That''s some unique lighting to be that balanced thruout.  The DOF is wonderful on this and what needs to be in focus is.  Good control of your environment.  The colors are saturated enough, but not overboard.  The connection to the theme is a little thin.  Yes, there are some spots, but they are a relatively small part of this composition.  That might hold this entry back some.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wow.  That''s some unique lighting to be that balanced thruout.  The DOF is wonderful on this and what needs to be in focus is.  Good control of your environment.  The colors are saturated enough, but not overboard.  The connection to the theme is a little thin.  Yes, there are some spots, but they are a relatively small part of this composition.  That might hold this entry back some.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039898, 426206, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s some cool spots there!  Good eye to see this one.  The background is perfect for this.  I''m not sure if it''s an optical illusion or not, but the photo seems a little blurry.  Like one of those images when you look at it the right way the dots move.  When I look at the lower right "leaf?" I can see the texture on the plant body so you''ve captured the detail.  Just weird the way those spots seem fuzzy.  Hope I''m the only one seeing it this way.  &lt;goes off to clean his glasses&gt;  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s some cool spots there!  Good eye to see this one.  The background is perfect for this.  I''m not sure if it''s an optical illusion or not, but the photo seems a little blurry.  Like one of those images when you look at it the right way the dots move.  When I look at the lower right "leaf?" I can see the texture on the plant body so you''ve captured the detail.  Just weird the way those spots seem fuzzy.  Hope I''m the only one seeing it this way.  <goes off to clean his glasses>  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 10:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039973, 426741, 30049, '<td valign="top">The colortone on this seems off.  Did you desat a channel or something?  How would this look in B/W?  Just curious.  I hope it didn''t hurt getting those "spots" off!  :D  As for the photo quality, the lighting could stand to be diffused some, unless you wanted those glare "spots" to show up on your big "spots".  The focus is nice and sharp on her nose and mouth, but seems to get soft around her eyes.</td>', 'The colortone on this seems off.  Did you desat a channel or something?  How would this look in B/W?  Just curious.  I hope it didn''t hurt getting those "spots" off!  :D  As for the photo quality, the lighting could stand to be diffused some, unless you wanted those glare "spots" to show up on your big "spots".  The focus is nice and sharp on her nose and mouth, but seems to get soft around her eyes.', '2006-11-17 10:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039976, 425727, 30049, '<td valign="top">That is one cool looking cat!  A little faster shutter speed would have froze the cat''s paw and whiskers (which are a little blurred).  Very good color and focus on the body and legs of the cat.  The red door/cabinet in the background pulls the viewers attention away unneedlessly and probably should have been cropped out.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That is one cool looking cat!  A little faster shutter speed would have froze the cat''s paw and whiskers (which are a little blurred).  Very good color and focus on the body and legs of the cat.  The red door/cabinet in the background pulls the viewers attention away unneedlessly and probably should have been cropped out.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 10:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039979, 425931, 30049, '<td valign="top">Clever and well executed.  Could see this one on the front page at rollover!  :D  Good luck.</td>', 'Clever and well executed.  Could see this one on the front page at rollover!  :D  Good luck.', '2006-11-17 10:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039985, 425660, 30049, '<td valign="top">That''s a mighty fine slice you took there with DOF.  Looks like you got the head area and back wing in focus - wish the front wing was also sharp.  Good eye to get out and see this photo opp for the challenge.  Did you happen to convert this to all B/W just to see what it looks like?  I''d be curious.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'That''s a mighty fine slice you took there with DOF.  Looks like you got the head area and back wing in focus - wish the front wing was also sharp.  Good eye to get out and see this photo opp for the challenge.  Did you happen to convert this to all B/W just to see what it looks like?  I''d be curious.  Anyway, good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039988, 427395, 30049, '<td valign="top">A unique approach to the challenge, and aptly used.  I really like how the light "spots" continue all the way up the far hillside.  The photo seems a little noisy and looks like it could use a small boost of contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'A unique approach to the challenge, and aptly used.  I really like how the light "spots" continue all the way up the far hillside.  The photo seems a little noisy and looks like it could use a small boost of contrast.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039990, 425070, 30049, '<td valign="top">Neat use of this reflection.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Neat use of this reflection.  Nicely done.', '2006-11-17 11:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3039994, 427375, 30049, '<td valign="top">Light thru straws is always pretty cool.  Wrap them up in a bracelet/necklace and voila!  Clever use of light and nice creative thinking here.  I really like the richness of the top half of this against the black background.  The bottom half is "ok" but not as strong IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Light thru straws is always pretty cool.  Wrap them up in a bracelet/necklace and voila!  Clever use of light and nice creative thinking here.  I really like the richness of the top half of this against the black background.  The bottom half is "ok" but not as strong IMO.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040004, 427444, 30049, '<td valign="top">Probably the best of the bunch (leaf spots) that I''ve seen yet.  The placement of the subject in your framing works well as does the background choice.  Very good detail in the leaf itself.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Probably the best of the bunch (leaf spots) that I''ve seen yet.  The placement of the subject in your framing works well as does the background choice.  Very good detail in the leaf itself.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040005, 427191, 30049, '<td valign="top">Uh-oh.</td>', 'Uh-oh.', '2006-11-17 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040007, 426338, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the bottom 2/3''s of this.  The top edge of the leaf is too dark and blurry IMO.  Good detail in the areas of the leaf that are sharply rendered.  The blue sky/mottled background works well also.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the bottom 2/3''s of this.  The top edge of the leaf is too dark and blurry IMO.  Good detail in the areas of the leaf that are sharply rendered.  The blue sky/mottled background works well also.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040011, 426787, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute portrait of your dog.  This would be stronger IMO if the backdrop wasn''t visible (small levels and/or contrast adj would black it out).  The double catchlight is a minor bummer.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute portrait of your dog.  This would be stronger IMO if the backdrop wasn''t visible (small levels and/or contrast adj would black it out).  The double catchlight is a minor bummer.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040021, 427423, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Nice title too.  :D  The color is very strong in this.  Almost too strong as I''m seeing some yellow in the whites.  The whites on the horse also appear to be slightly overexposed.  A consideration for this shot would be to lose the area above the roof line.  It''s not really adding anything to the photo and is slightly distracting IMO.  Give the horse a little more breathing room in the framing of your photo - it''s a bit tight.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute.  Nice title too.  :D  The color is very strong in this.  Almost too strong as I''m seeing some yellow in the whites.  The whites on the horse also appear to be slightly overexposed.  A consideration for this shot would be to lose the area above the roof line.  It''s not really adding anything to the photo and is slightly distracting IMO.  Give the horse a little more breathing room in the framing of your photo - it''s a bit tight.  All JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040022, 427024, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok, this works.  :D  Good detail and it''s sharp.  The color temp is a little cool (bluish) and could start warming up some.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Ok, this works.  :D  Good detail and it''s sharp.  The color temp is a little cool (bluish) and could start warming up some.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040030, 426925, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice props and good placement of the key elements in your composition.  The lighting is near the edge on being too hot (you''ve lost some detail in woodys shoulder and head).  Cute idea with the spotted kerchief.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice props and good placement of the key elements in your composition.  The lighting is near the edge on being too hot (you''ve lost some detail in woodys shoulder and head).  Cute idea with the spotted kerchief.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040035, 426975, 30049, '<td valign="top">What an adorable face and smile!  :D  Very nice portrait here.  Hard to tell for sure with this work monitor, but the tonal range looks a little flat, like you''re short on the blacks a little.  Overall, nicely done.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'What an adorable face and smile!  :D  Very nice portrait here.  Hard to tell for sure with this work monitor, but the tonal range looks a little flat, like you''re short on the blacks a little.  Overall, nicely done.  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040036, 425499, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  I''m having a hard time finding anyplace to settle in with this.  It all looks blurry and without a focal point.  Sorry, JMO of course.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yikes!  I''m having a hard time finding anyplace to settle in with this.  It all looks blurry and without a focal point.  Sorry, JMO of course.  Good luck.', '2006-11-17 11:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040042, 426949, 30049, '<td valign="top">Wonderful texture and detail.  Clever idea on the "Spots" connection - hopefully the viewers will agree that there''s enough spots.  Very nice tonal range covering the blacks to whites.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Wonderful texture and detail.  Clever idea on the "Spots" connection - hopefully the viewers will agree that there''s enough spots.  Very nice tonal range covering the blacks to whites.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 11:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040046, 427267, 16402, '<td valign="top">Sorry, don''t see any "spots" so DNMC. Nice grahic image though.</td>', 'Sorry, don''t see any "spots" so DNMC. Nice grahic image though.', '2006-11-17 11:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040048, 425818, 30049, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Kind of.  Seems too documentary to me personally.  Would work well in a science school book or something perhaps.</td>', 'Interesting.  Kind of.  Seems too documentary to me personally.  Would work well in a science school book or something perhaps.', '2006-11-17 11:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040055, 427191, 50695, '<td valign="top">Is this an attempt at a Seurat look? I admire the experimentation, but the composition isn''t that interesting. 6</td>', 'Is this an attempt at a Seurat look? I admire the experimentation, but the composition isn''t that interesting. 6', '2006-11-17 11:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040056, 427088, 50695, '<td valign="top">creepy!</td>', 'creepy!', '2006-11-17 11:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040058, 427372, 50695, '<td valign="top">good idea. good execution.</td>', 'good idea. good execution.', '2006-11-17 11:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040065, 427477, 50695, '<td valign="top">cool composition. 7</td>', 'cool composition. 7', '2006-11-17 11:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040087, 426868, 67671, '<td valign="top">they sure are, and a good sharp focus, and even exposure, not keen on the border, but it won''t effect my judgment on the shot, well done.</td>', 'they sure are, and a good sharp focus, and even exposure, not keen on the border, but it won''t effect my judgment on the shot, well done.', '2006-11-17 11:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040093, 427399, 67671, '<td valign="top">looks like it has been splashed with ink, if it is it has been done well, nice and even, I may be wrong, either way it''s an excelent shot. well done</td>', 'looks like it has been splashed with ink, if it is it has been done well, nice and even, I may be wrong, either way it''s an excelent shot. well done', '2006-11-17 12:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040103, 427476, 67671, '<td valign="top">fits the frame, and the challange, sharp focus, good exposure, well deserved 10</td>', 'fits the frame, and the challange, sharp focus, good exposure, well deserved 10', '2006-11-17 12:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040106, 426119, 67671, '<td valign="top">fits the challange well, love the colours, and the framing. well done</td>', 'fits the challange well, love the colours, and the framing. well done', '2006-11-17 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040113, 427538, 67671, '<td valign="top">great pose, the eyes have a strange colour, other wise a great shot, well framed, well done.</td>', 'great pose, the eyes have a strange colour, other wise a great shot, well framed, well done.', '2006-11-17 12:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040126, 426157, 67671, '<td valign="top">nice crisp focus on the flowers, and they are well light, but I think the background could be better, black is not working for me, still an excelent shot.</td>', 'nice crisp focus on the flowers, and they are well light, but I think the background could be better, black is not working for me, still an excelent shot.', '2006-11-17 12:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040135, 427461, 67671, '<td valign="top">most unusual landscape, fits the challange well, let down just a little by the sky, great colour, and well framed.</td>', 'most unusual landscape, fits the challange well, let down just a little by the sky, great colour, and well framed.', '2006-11-17 12:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040136, 427563, 67671, '<td valign="top">I like the hand over the mouth, seems to draw the attention away from the eyes</td>', 'I like the hand over the mouth, seems to draw the attention away from the eyes', '2006-11-17 12:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040151, 427500, 67671, '<td valign="top">great idea, and well executed, go on I dare you, well done.</td>', 'great idea, and well executed, go on I dare you, well done.', '2006-11-17 12:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040157, 427010, 67671, '<td valign="top">great idea, hope you never got any in your eye, nice frame, slight hot spot on your forhead, still a great shot. well done</td>', 'great idea, hope you never got any in your eye, nice frame, slight hot spot on your forhead, still a great shot. well done', '2006-11-17 12:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040167, 427381, 67671, '<td valign="top">good lighting effect, good ficus on the face, good shot.</td>', 'good lighting effect, good ficus on the face, good shot.', '2006-11-17 12:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040168, 426206, 36850, '<td valign="top">If this photo was a bit clearer it would be fantastic.</td>', 'If this photo was a bit clearer it would be fantastic.', '2006-11-17 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040181, 427575, 67671, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, the red against the green works well for me, good sharp image, well framed, and the spots and dashes of white, make it fit the challange. well done</td>', 'this is a great shot, the red against the green works well for me, good sharp image, well framed, and the spots and dashes of white, make it fit the challange. well done', '2006-11-17 12:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040184, 427404, 67671, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot, the beads of water, and the middle, almost looks like a golf ball, well framed, perfect exposure.</td>', 'this is a great shot, the beads of water, and the middle, almost looks like a golf ball, well framed, perfect exposure.', '2006-11-17 12:44:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040235, 427267, 31829, '<td valign="top">I see lines not spots.... ;-)</td>', 'I see lines not spots.... ;-)', '2006-11-17 13:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040238, 425931, 61755, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept and title!  But the composition seems just a bit "unbalanced" for my tastes.  I think I would like it better if a tad more of the leg was cropped at the top, or if there was more space below the umbrella.</td>', 'Interesting concept and title!  But the composition seems just a bit "unbalanced" for my tastes.  I think I would like it better if a tad more of the leg was cropped at the top, or if there was more space below the umbrella.', '2006-11-17 13:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040240, 427126, 31829, '<td valign="top">Looking up nostrils is yucky!</td>', 'Looking up nostrils is yucky!', '2006-11-17 13:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040253, 427555, 31829, '<td valign="top">Sharp "line" blurry "spots" ;-)</td>', 'Sharp "line" blurry "spots" ;-)', '2006-11-17 13:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040264, 425618, 51538, '<td valign="top">Simple design nicely executed. 8.</td>', 'Simple design nicely executed. 8.', '2006-11-17 13:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040268, 427130, 51538, '<td valign="top">Elegant, nice colours and design. 8.</td>', 'Elegant, nice colours and design. 8.', '2006-11-17 13:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040273, 427306, 51538, '<td valign="top">One of the best images from this challenge. 8.</td>', 'One of the best images from this challenge. 8.', '2006-11-17 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3040279, 427401, 51538, '<td valign="top">Lenticles, I think those marking are called in Betula species.  Simple but very pleasant. 7.</td>', 'Lenticles, I think those marking are called in Betula species.  Simple but very pleasant. 7.', '2006-11-17 13:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040280, 425630, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very striking photo. I like the footprints, even though they might be thought undesirable.</td>', 'Very striking photo. I like the footprints, even though they might be thought undesirable.', '2006-11-17 13:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040291, 427088, 45790, '<td valign="top">I gave this one of my top scores because it is so intriguing. But photographically I feel it is too flat -- Needs more contrast.</td>', 'I gave this one of my top scores because it is so intriguing. But photographically I feel it is too flat -- Needs more contrast.', '2006-11-17 13:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040293, 427577, 45790, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and lighting. High score for sure.</td>', 'Lovely composition and lighting. High score for sure.', '2006-11-17 13:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040303, 426935, 45790, '<td valign="top">I love the idea. Lighting could be better though -- it needs to be more even. Was this taken using a flash?? If so, at least bounce it.</td>', 'I love the idea. Lighting could be better though -- it needs to be more even. Was this taken using a flash?? If so, at least bounce it.', '2006-11-17 13:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040401, 425931, 50695, '<td valign="top">I predict a ribbon for this. I''ll give you a 6 for working so hard. Is this idnic?</td>', 'I predict a ribbon for this. I''ll give you a 6 for working so hard. Is this idnic?', '2006-11-17 14:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040443, 426206, 67152, '<td valign="top">i love the spots and the colors - but the focus seems very off</td>', 'i love the spots and the colors - but the focus seems very off', '2006-11-17 14:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040466, 424898, 30049, '<td valign="top">This seems so busy, both the subject and the background, that it''s rather uncomfortable to view.  Could also stand to apply some sharpening to this.  It''s quite colorful!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This seems so busy, both the subject and the background, that it''s rather uncomfortable to view.  Could also stand to apply some sharpening to this.  It''s quite colorful!  :D  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040478, 425744, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ahhh.  Thanks for entering something worth looking at.  :D  I guess you went with the duotone instead of color to minimize distractions?  It works.  Nice, well-focused, and well-composed photo here.  Well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.</td>', 'Ahhh.  Thanks for entering something worth looking at.  :D  I guess you went with the duotone instead of color to minimize distractions?  It works.  Nice, well-focused, and well-composed photo here.  Well done!  Best of luck to you in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040480, 427470, 30049, '<td valign="top">Haven''t quite figured out what this is.  A universal black hole with an alien ship approaching?  :D  It''s fun to guess, up to a point.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge is over to see what it is.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Haven''t quite figured out what this is.  A universal black hole with an alien ship approaching?  :D  It''s fun to guess, up to a point.  I''ll have to come back after the challenge is over to see what it is.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040483, 427200, 327, '<td valign="top">Love this, don''t have a clue what it is, but one of my top rated for the challenge. Good luck.</td>', 'Love this, don''t have a clue what it is, but one of my top rated for the challenge. Good luck.', '2006-11-17 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040485, 425931, 327, '<td valign="top">Is she hanging from the ceiling? LOL Just super. Love the high-key look. Wonderful take on the challenge!! Well done. One of my top rated for the challenge.</td>', 'Is she hanging from the ceiling? LOL Just super. Love the high-key look. Wonderful take on the challenge!! Well done. One of my top rated for the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040487, 427154, 327, '<td valign="top">Even if this wasn''t about spots I love this shot. The make-up is really nicely done and I love her casual, relaxed pose. Nice one.</td>', 'Even if this wasn''t about spots I love this shot. The make-up is really nicely done and I love her casual, relaxed pose. Nice one.', '2006-11-17 15:16:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040488, 425618, 327, '<td valign="top">Well done for this challenge.</td>', 'Well done for this challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040490, 427306, 327, '<td valign="top">Jackie_O, fun shot, love her smile and pose. Well done.</td>', 'Jackie_O, fun shot, love her smile and pose. Well done.', '2006-11-17 15:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040491, 424867, 30049, '<td valign="top">What is it?  An ice bucket?  A cookie jar?  Have never seen anything quite like it.  It makes for an interesting image.  I think the lighting could have been diffused some for a cleaner look.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What is it?  An ice bucket?  A cookie jar?  Have never seen anything quite like it.  It makes for an interesting image.  I think the lighting could have been diffused some for a cleaner look.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040492, 427126, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. Spot on for this challenge!! ;}</td>', 'Nicely done. Spot on for this challenge!! ;}', '2006-11-17 15:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040493, 425870, 327, '<td valign="top">Several like this. Creative ideas and I like this one, he really seems to fade into the background. Well done.</td>', 'Several like this. Creative ideas and I like this one, he really seems to fade into the background. Well done.', '2006-11-17 15:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040494, 427192, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty simple, a good image and love the light and color. Well done.</td>', 'Pretty simple, a good image and love the light and color. Well done.', '2006-11-17 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040498, 427192, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well, not exactly spotless.  If this were truly "spotless" (minus the hair) it would score a little higher.  Also, the positioning - you might as well have gone and centered it, I think it would have looked a little better that way.  JMO of course.  As is, I think it''s a clever entry and still rises above many.  Just came up a bit short on a couple of minor details.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, not exactly spotless.  If this were truly "spotless" (minus the hair) it would score a little higher.  Also, the positioning - you might as well have gone and centered it, I think it would have looked a little better that way.  JMO of course.  As is, I think it''s a clever entry and still rises above many.  Just came up a bit short on a couple of minor details.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040501, 426378, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t get paint on your camera!  :D  Interesting subject.  I wonder if a polarizer would have knocked the glare off the paintball dispenser some?  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Hope you didn''t get paint on your camera!  :D  Interesting subject.  I wonder if a polarizer would have knocked the glare off the paintball dispenser some?  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040506, 427010, 30049, '<td valign="top">This has potential.  Lighting doesn''t seem quite right to get the look I think you were after.  The background didn''t come out true white, which would be stronger.  Some fill light on the right would help, and nice sharp focus on her eyes is important.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'This has potential.  Lighting doesn''t seem quite right to get the look I think you were after.  The background didn''t come out true white, which would be stronger.  Some fill light on the right would help, and nice sharp focus on her eyes is important.  JMO of course.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-11-17 15:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040546, 427304, 64570, '<td valign="top">There''s something about the spot that ruins this one for me.  It just looks too perfect and you can sort of see through it.</td>', 'There''s something about the spot that ruins this one for me.  It just looks too perfect and you can sort of see through it.', '2006-11-17 15:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040569, 424867, 64570, '<td valign="top">Not sure what that is on top of the dice.  Would prefer the picture without it.</td>', 'Not sure what that is on top of the dice.  Would prefer the picture without it.', '2006-11-17 15:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040810, 427600, 52301, '<td valign="top">you should have called it "G-spot!"</td>', 'you should have called it "G-spot!"', '2006-11-17 17:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040842, 427487, 50034, '<td valign="top">Nicely illustrated!  Spot on!  Cheers!  :)</td>', 'Nicely illustrated!  Spot on!  Cheers!  :)', '2006-11-17 17:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3040891, 427267, 59195, '<td valign="top">Where are the spots?</td>', 'Where are the spots?', '2006-11-17 17:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041007, 427461, 39679, '<td valign="top">There''s a great shot in here.  The bit in the center front, cropped tight, would have been outstanding.  In fact, almost anything in near frame would make an outstanding shot.  A common mistake is to try to include too much and this is a classic example.  I''d LOVE to see you shoot this again but explore the near field objects.  Zoom in tight on some of the interesting elements.  I think You''d have several outstanding images.</td>', 'There''s a great shot in here.  The bit in the center front, cropped tight, would have been outstanding.  In fact, almost anything in near frame would make an outstanding shot.  A common mistake is to try to include too much and this is a classic example.  I''d LOVE to see you shoot this again but explore the near field objects.  Zoom in tight on some of the interesting elements.  I think You''d have several outstanding images.', '2006-11-17 19:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041066, 427220, 43869, '<td valign="top">freaky!  Great idea and well executed.</td>', 'freaky!  Great idea and well executed.', '2006-11-17 19:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041068, 427501, 43869, '<td valign="top">Oh very nice!   Love the path too.</td>', 'Oh very nice!   Love the path too.', '2006-11-17 19:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041070, 426747, 43869, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!   Awsome focus and coloring.  Feel like I''m sitting right there.</td>', 'Beautiful!   Awsome focus and coloring.  Feel like I''m sitting right there.', '2006-11-17 19:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041072, 427444, 43869, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in color between the leaf and the background.   This leaf doesn''t make me think of "spots" though.  But I like it.</td>', 'I like the contrast in color between the leaf and the background.   This leaf doesn''t make me think of "spots" though.  But I like it.', '2006-11-17 19:49:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041076, 427264, 43869, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea,  love the black bg,  however,  I think the focus could be better.</td>', 'This is a great idea,  love the black bg,  however,  I think the focus could be better.', '2006-11-17 19:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041077, 426572, 43869, '<td valign="top">LOVE the desat here.   very nice work.</td>', 'LOVE the desat here.   very nice work.', '2006-11-17 19:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041079, 427203, 43869, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the few spots at the top that got wacked off,  kind of takes away from the rest of the picture.   I like the simplicity of this and the border goes well with the subject itself.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the few spots at the top that got wacked off,  kind of takes away from the rest of the picture.   I like the simplicity of this and the border goes well with the subject itself.', '2006-11-17 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041082, 427470, 65234, '<td valign="top">How fascinating!  A really fun image to look at and nicely composed and cropped to get the eye/pupil effect.</td>', 'How fascinating!  A really fun image to look at and nicely composed and cropped to get the eye/pupil effect.', '2006-11-17 19:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041088, 427423, 43869, '<td valign="top">lol love the title.  It''s a little too contrasty for my liking.  But great capture either way.</td>', 'lol love the title.  It''s a little too contrasty for my liking.  But great capture either way.', '2006-11-17 19:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
