(3041938, 425818, 51802, '<td valign="top">I love astrophotography.  I have recently purchased the adapters to connect my camera to my scope, but I have yet to get results this good!  Very well done!!!</td>', 'I love astrophotography.  I have recently purchased the adapters to connect my camera to my scope, but I have yet to get results this good!  Very well done!!!', '2006-11-18 12:45:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041948, 427191, 51802, '<td valign="top">I am very curious to know what this photo means to you.  There are no spots, so you don''t seem to be concerned with the challenge, so there must be some other reason for sharing this.<br/> <br/>Technically, there are a few things wrong with this.  <br/>1. It is over exposed.  The building in the background is washed out.  A faster shutter speed would help control this.<br/>2.  There is a lot of camera shake which makes this shot look blurry.  This could also be helped by a faster shutter speed.<br/>3.  The composition is crooked.  One mistake I often make is focusing on the subject as I look through the camera, you must remember to look at the border around the image when you are taking the picture.<br/> <br/>I hope all of this is helpful!</td>', 'I am very curious to know what this photo means to you.  There are no spots, so you don''t seem to be concerned with the challenge, so there must be some other reason for sharing this. Technically, there are a few things wrong with this.  1. It is over exposed.  The building in the background is washed out.  A faster shutter speed would help control this.2.  There is a lot of camera shake which makes this shot look blurry.  This could also be helped by a faster shutter speed.3.  The composition is crooked.  One mistake I often make is focusing on the subject as I look through the camera, you must remember to look at the border around the image when you are taking the picture. I hope all of this is helpful!', '2006-11-18 12:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041949, 426965, 51802, '<td valign="top">I don''t care for the blurred effect.  Maybe if it were a little less extreme, it would be more pleasing.</td>', 'I don''t care for the blurred effect.  Maybe if it were a little less extreme, it would be more pleasing.', '2006-11-18 12:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3041951, 426656, 51802, '<td valign="top">This shot does meet the challenge, but that is about it.  There is nothing here to really hold the viewer''s interest or stir an emotion.  You did incorporate a shallow depth of field, but again, that is lost without having an element that is emphasized by that technique.</td>', 'This shot does meet the challenge, but that is about it.  There is nothing here to really hold the viewer''s interest or stir an emotion.  You did incorporate a shallow depth of field, but again, that is lost without having an element that is emphasized by that technique.', '2006-11-18 12:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
