(3042283, 427493, 50034, '<td valign="top">What a sweet portrait!  :)  However, please be advised that the eyes are not in clear focus.  That little NO-NO could be considered the Unpardonable Sin of Portrait Photographers!  The rule I learned goes something like this, "Locate the Alpha Female in every grouping, and focus on her eyes.  If you get that right,...then everyone else will be more than happy!"  :)</td>', 'What a sweet portrait!  :)  However, please be advised that the eyes are not in clear focus.  That little NO-NO could be considered the Unpardonable Sin of Portrait Photographers!  The rule I learned goes something like this, "Locate the Alpha Female in every grouping, and focus on her eyes.  If you get that right,...then everyone else will be more than happy!"  :)', '2006-11-18 18:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
