(3042537, 425600, 65107, '<td valign="top">great photo. Beautiful water but maybe too much of a good thing. More tightly cropped particularly at the top.  I partially scroll the image off my computer screen and I like it better.<br/> <br/>What''s with the water? really clear, shallow light colored bottom.  Like liquid silver at the bottom and clear as glass at the top.</td>', 'great photo. Beautiful water but maybe too much of a good thing. More tightly cropped particularly at the top.  I partially scroll the image off my computer screen and I like it better. What''s with the water? really clear, shallow light colored bottom.  Like liquid silver at the bottom and clear as glass at the top.', '2006-11-18 19:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
