(3043001, 425630, 24454, '<td valign="top">I really really like this one!   I like the texture, and I like the composition.   It''s very simple, but clean and very cool lookikng.  I think I might like it even a tiny bit more without the white thing on the top one, but everything else is so appealing to me it only detracts a little!   Great job!  9</td>', 'I really really like this one!   I like the texture, and I like the composition.   It''s very simple, but clean and very cool lookikng.  I think I might like it even a tiny bit more without the white thing on the top one, but everything else is so appealing to me it only detracts a little!   Great job!  9', '2006-11-19 01:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043052, 425798, 32872, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, ya know, a pic of the spotted dog licking the child''s lollypop would make a good image.</td>', 'Nice lighting, ya know, a pic of the spotted dog licking the child''s lollypop would make a good image.', '2006-11-19 02:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043068, 427010, 57381, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. Some observations that may have improved it a little. The shoulder looks a little odd, hunchec a bit perhaps or crossed in the lap. I like the side lighting, but might have liked it a bit better with soft light on the front of the face as well so as to have less harsh shadows. I really like the crop and general setup/use of props. Also on her forehead seems to be a bit of a purple tinge to the light. Nice use of thirds, as well.</td>', 'Excellent photo. Some observations that may have improved it a little. The shoulder looks a little odd, hunchec a bit perhaps or crossed in the lap. I like the side lighting, but might have liked it a bit better with soft light on the front of the face as well so as to have less harsh shadows. I really like the crop and general setup/use of props. Also on her forehead seems to be a bit of a purple tinge to the light. Nice use of thirds, as well.', '2006-11-19 02:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3043085, 426925, 41531, '<td valign="top">very cute! good composition and lighting</td>', 'very cute! good composition and lighting', '2006-11-19 03:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
