(3044113, 425727, 60173, '<td valign="top">The white object in the bottom right corner distracts me a bit. The photo as a whole seems a touch blurry, but it''s still by far one of the best shots of the challenge. Love the colors. Beautiful cat.</td>', 'The white object in the bottom right corner distracts me a bit. The photo as a whole seems a touch blurry, but it''s still by far one of the best shots of the challenge. Love the colors. Beautiful cat.', '2006-11-19 16:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044116, 427476, 60173, '<td valign="top">It looks like you have a little sharpening halo on the right side, and he seems a little cramped in the photo. Some of your whites are just a wee bit blown out, but honestly that''s all just fishing for something to improve on. You''re still in my top 5 picks, heh.</td>', 'It looks like you have a little sharpening halo on the right side, and he seems a little cramped in the photo. Some of your whites are just a wee bit blown out, but honestly that''s all just fishing for something to improve on. You''re still in my top 5 picks, heh.', '2006-11-19 17:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044118, 427178, 60173, '<td valign="top">That there... that''s som''thin''... At first I said to myself "that''s retarded." Then I sat back.. and.. liked it! I can actually see this hung in a classy kitchen, cafe, etc. The colors are quite pleasing. I can''t believe I like jam splattered on a wall, sigh. <br/> <br/>I hope others can see it too. Good luck  =)</td>', 'That there... that''s som''thin''... At first I said to myself "that''s retarded." Then I sat back.. and.. liked it! I can actually see this hung in a classy kitchen, cafe, etc. The colors are quite pleasing. I can''t believe I like jam splattered on a wall, sigh.  I hope others can see it too. Good luck  =)', '2006-11-19 17:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044123, 427130, 60173, '<td valign="top">Your white stripe tilts to the right a bit. It also looks like it''s separating from the background? It looks like there''s a shadow on the top left of the white paper. With that all said, I doubt anyone will notice! Nice job.</td>', 'Your white stripe tilts to the right a bit. It also looks like it''s separating from the background? It looks like there''s a shadow on the top left of the white paper. With that all said, I doubt anyone will notice! Nice job.', '2006-11-19 17:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044129, 425451, 60173, '<td valign="top">Other than the glare on the band going across the B this is a pretty nice clean shot. To be honest though there''s not really anything interesting going on. It would have been nice to see more of the wrapping leaf texture.</td>', 'Other than the glare on the band going across the B this is a pretty nice clean shot. To be honest though there''s not really anything interesting going on. It would have been nice to see more of the wrapping leaf texture.', '2006-11-19 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044135, 427137, 60173, '<td valign="top">I can''t honestly say I really understand this photo. I still like it though.</td>', 'I can''t honestly say I really understand this photo. I still like it though.', '2006-11-19 17:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
