(3044155, 426383, 60173, '<td valign="top">While technically it''s a nice clean shot, there''s nothing realy interesting. Maybe it''s because I rode the bus in school and it just brings back "meh" memories.</td>', 'While technically it''s a nice clean shot, there''s nothing realy interesting. Maybe it''s because I rode the bus in school and it just brings back "meh" memories.', '2006-11-19 17:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
