(3044163, 427500, 60173, '<td valign="top">I think this would look better moved a tad to the left to get the whole game piece in the shot and lose the little m&amp;m guy. This might be a personal hatred for the little m&amp;m guy. I worked in an arcade for 4 years and I''m really burnt out on them, heh. Still nice shot though.</td>', 'I think this would look better moved a tad to the left to get the whole game piece in the shot and lose the little m&m guy. This might be a personal hatred for the little m&m guy. I worked in an arcade for 4 years and I''m really burnt out on them, heh. Still nice shot though.', '2006-11-19 17:30:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3044169, 427577, 60173, '<td valign="top">This looks better flipped horizontally for me. Maybe it''s a language thing since I''m used to reading left to right. My eye wants to look at the top half of the petal, but it has to start at the bottom left and go up. If the more interesting part is in the top left corner it''s much more relaxing on my eyes.</td>', 'This looks better flipped horizontally for me. Maybe it''s a language thing since I''m used to reading left to right. My eye wants to look at the top half of the petal, but it has to start at the bottom left and go up. If the more interesting part is in the top left corner it''s much more relaxing on my eyes.', '2006-11-19 17:32:42.000000', NULL, 1),
