(3049894, 426852, 53572, '<td valign="top">an interesting idea, but there are a few things bringing its score down.  the flash is quite harsh in the foreground, and falls off very quickly over the board, which you''d expect to be the subject of the image.  the depth of field seems unintentionally shallow for hte composition.  also, the small size of the image doesn''t help the resolutionor picture quality.  a good start to an image, but woudl benefit from reshooting.  keep on shooting!</td>', 'an interesting idea, but there are a few things bringing its score down.  the flash is quite harsh in the foreground, and falls off very quickly over the board, which you''d expect to be the subject of the image.  the depth of field seems unintentionally shallow for hte composition.  also, the small size of the image doesn''t help the resolutionor picture quality.  a good start to an image, but woudl benefit from reshooting.  keep on shooting!', '2006-11-21 06:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
