(3051047, 427112, 60862, '<td valign="top">Can''t quite put my finger on it, but this isn''t drawing me in.  Maybe there''s not enough contrast between the leaves and the background.  I don''t mean in the sense of the contrast slider in a graphics program, but more the shapes.  A simple spray of these spotted leaves on a plain background would''ve been more engaging.</td>', 'Can''t quite put my finger on it, but this isn''t drawing me in.  Maybe there''s not enough contrast between the leaves and the background.  I don''t mean in the sense of the contrast slider in a graphics program, but more the shapes.  A simple spray of these spotted leaves on a plain background would''ve been more engaging.', '2006-11-21 15:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051057, 427129, 60862, '<td valign="top">Aside from the spots not being the main focal point, this is cropped a little too tightly and the lighting is kind of dull.  Try playing with levels, curves, or even just the brightness/contrast sliders.</td>', 'Aside from the spots not being the main focal point, this is cropped a little too tightly and the lighting is kind of dull.  Try playing with levels, curves, or even just the brightness/contrast sliders.', '2006-11-21 15:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051058, 427538, 60862, '<td valign="top">Flash makes for harsh shadows.  Try lighting it very brightly instead and not using the flash.</td>', 'Flash makes for harsh shadows.  Try lighting it very brightly instead and not using the flash.', '2006-11-21 15:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051059, 427302, 60862, '<td valign="top">Try enhancing the contrast.  This is pretty washed out.</td>', 'Try enhancing the contrast.  This is pretty washed out.', '2006-11-21 15:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
