(3051066, 427404, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but the contrast and focus are both quite low.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but the contrast and focus are both quite low.', '2006-11-21 15:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051067, 427480, 60862, '<td valign="top">Sorry - not really a pic I want to look at.  Aside from that, it might have worked better cropped differently, with more space to the left and less to the right, so we have a sense of where she''s looking.</td>', 'Sorry - not really a pic I want to look at.  Aside from that, it might have worked better cropped differently, with more space to the left and less to the right, so we have a sense of where she''s looking.', '2006-11-21 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051069, 427288, 60862, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice shape, but the centered composition isn''t grabbing me.  Also, it''s not especially sharp.  Did you take this without a tripod?  Or maybe the autofocus went to the flame, and since it was dark, the wide aperture meant nothing else was sharp?<br/> <br/>Outside of the challenge, I think this could be a really nice shot.  Try retaking it with the candle over on the left, using a tripod, and shutting the aperture down some to get everything sharp.</td>', 'It''s a nice shape, but the centered composition isn''t grabbing me.  Also, it''s not especially sharp.  Did you take this without a tripod?  Or maybe the autofocus went to the flame, and since it was dark, the wide aperture meant nothing else was sharp? Outside of the challenge, I think this could be a really nice shot.  Try retaking it with the candle over on the left, using a tripod, and shutting the aperture down some to get everything sharp.', '2006-11-21 15:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051076, 427502, 51017, '<td valign="top">not very creative</td>', 'not very creative', '2006-11-21 16:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051078, 427304, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ooo - try something with that glove for light on white.  But either blur out the texture or get it razor sharp.  The in-between kind-of-fuzzy kind-of-sharp is making my eyes all googly.  And a single spot just isn''t grabbing my interest.</td>', 'Ooo - try something with that glove for light on white.  But either blur out the texture or get it razor sharp.  The in-between kind-of-fuzzy kind-of-sharp is making my eyes all googly.  And a single spot just isn''t grabbing my interest.', '2006-11-21 16:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
