(3051092, 426935, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but something''s missing.  That pose just doesn''t seem especially corpse-like, esp. with his eyes open.  But it''s also just not engaging my imagination.</td>', 'Nice try, but something''s missing.  That pose just doesn''t seem especially corpse-like, esp. with his eyes open.  But it''s also just not engaging my imagination.', '2006-11-21 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
