(3051098, 427559, 60862, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - good use of the shapes.  The lighting''s pretty flat, though.  The white dice are quite gray, just about matching the gray background for the page.  Try enhancing the contrast and see what you think.  That should also help get rid of the distracting texture of the background.<br/> <br/>Pure white and bright green on absolute black, and this would do much better.</td>', 'Nice composition - good use of the shapes.  The lighting''s pretty flat, though.  The white dice are quite gray, just about matching the gray background for the page.  Try enhancing the contrast and see what you think.  That should also help get rid of the distracting texture of the background. Pure white and bright green on absolute black, and this would do much better.', '2006-11-21 16:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051101, 427267, 60862, '<td valign="top">I''m betting I''m not the only one to point out that this is a spots challenge, not striped.  Therefore, I can''t vote it as high as I would otherwise.  That said, I like this composition a lot, and I think it''ll be a nice addition to your portfolio.</td>', 'I''m betting I''m not the only one to point out that this is a spots challenge, not striped.  Therefore, I can''t vote it as high as I would otherwise.  That said, I like this composition a lot, and I think it''ll be a nice addition to your portfolio.', '2006-11-21 16:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051103, 426952, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.</td>', 'Interesting abstract.', '2006-11-21 16:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051110, 427381, 60862, '<td valign="top">So many questions ...<br/>Why is he all wet?<br/>What ARE those spots?<br/>Why does he look sad?  bored?  tired?<br/> <br/>I gotta say, the lighting''s kind of dull, but I''m voting a 6 because of the mystery. :)</td>', 'So many questions ...Why is he all wet?What ARE those spots?Why does he look sad?  bored?  tired? I gotta say, the lighting''s kind of dull, but I''m voting a 6 because of the mystery. :)', '2006-11-21 16:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051112, 427518, 60862, '<td valign="top">Chuckle.</td>', 'Chuckle.', '2006-11-21 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051142, 426852, 60862, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, but the lighting is off and there seems to be a bluish tint to it.  The striped background also distracts.<br/> <br/>Look at this one for an example of how high contrast and a simple background can enhance the image: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=189757" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/349/thumb/189757.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/349/thumb/189757.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/349/thumb/189757.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Interesting subject, but the lighting is off and there seems to be a bluish tint to it.  The striped background also distracts. Look at this one for an example of how high contrast and a simple background can enhance the image: ', '2006-11-21 16:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051148, 426338, 60862, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea.  For me, though, this falls between pure macro, where what it is doesn''t much matter, and normal, where I want to know what I''m looking at.</td>', 'Not a bad idea.  For me, though, this falls between pure macro, where what it is doesn''t much matter, and normal, where I want to know what I''m looking at.', '2006-11-21 16:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051178, 425727, 29659, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped much more tightly from the left.</td>', 'I would have cropped much more tightly from the left.', '2006-11-21 16:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3051188, 427160, 29659, '<td valign="top">Clever setup.  :)</td>', 'Clever setup.  :)', '2006-11-21 16:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
