(3054163, 427264, 65603, '<td valign="top">Thank you !! This image has just giving me a PB to date. As for the shot I set the die up on a black cloth, and propped the die against one another. I took my shots from different angles and this was my fav. On the focus, my camera is starting to really give, it focus''s only when it wants. Which is odd. Anyway the die are not falling as they appear.</td>', 'Thank you !! This image has just giving me a PB to date. As for the shot I set the die up on a black cloth, and propped the die against one another. I took my shots from different angles and this was my fav. On the focus, my camera is starting to really give, it focus''s only when it wants. Which is odd. Anyway the die are not falling as they appear.', '2006-11-22 11:11:12.000000', NULL, 0),
