(3054453, 425931, 3102, '<td valign="top">First off, congrats on a great shot!  It''s certainly a well-earned ribbon.  Here''s the weird thing for me.  Every time I see the thumbnail on the home page, I see a high-key picture of a bare-butted woman bending over (ignoring the legs).  This is an unintentional optical illusion!</td>', 'First off, congrats on a great shot!  It''s certainly a well-earned ribbon.  Here''s the weird thing for me.  Every time I see the thumbnail on the home page, I see a high-key picture of a bare-butted woman bending over (ignoring the legs).  This is an unintentional optical illusion!', '2006-11-22 12:37:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(3054612, 425931, 15266, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by alanfreed:</b></div><hr/><i> First off, congrats on a great shot!  It''s certainly a well-earned ribbon.  Here''s the weird thing for me.  Every time I see the thumbnail on the home page, I see a high-key picture of a bare-butted woman bending over (ignoring the legs).  This is an unintentional optical illusion! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>ROFL  Seriously?  I don''t see it!  That''s great! :D</td>', 'Originally posted by alanfreed: First off, congrats on a great shot!  It''s certainly a well-earned ribbon.  Here''s the weird thing for me.  Every time I see the thumbnail on the home page, I see a high-key picture of a bare-butted woman bending over (ignoring the legs).  This is an unintentional optical illusion!   ROFL  Seriously?  I don''t see it!  That''s great! :D', '2006-11-22 13:08:19.000000', NULL, 0),
