(3055876, 427523, 55838, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> I was one of your 8s. I had hoped to see this finish a bit higher. Thought it was a nice creative take on the challenge and had good artistic quality to it. Nice work. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I just got home from work and was scrolling through to see how the grater finished and, low and behold, I see the words that I would have said already posted by Mr thetoo.  I guess we must be soulmates...or something.  :)  Very creative and such great lighting and color tones.  Absolutely stunned that this did not get ya a very strong 6.</td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: I was one of your 8s. I had hoped to see this finish a bit higher. Thought it was a nice creative take on the challenge and had good artistic quality to it. Nice work.  I just got home from work and was scrolling through to see how the grater finished and, low and behold, I see the words that I would have said already posted by Mr thetoo.  I guess we must be soulmates...or something.  :)  Very creative and such great lighting and color tones.  Absolutely stunned that this did not get ya a very strong 6.', '2006-11-22 18:37:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(3055886, 427521, 55838, '<td valign="top">Not a bad score.  I was one of your 7''s.  This shot brought back those memories of staring at the Christmas tree partially cross-eyed so that the lights blurred beautifully like this.  Do I sound crazy?  Am I the only one who has ever done that?  If so, I was just kidding....I had a friend who said she did that once...um...yeah that''s it!  :)  Thanks for the nostalgic moment!</td>', 'Not a bad score.  I was one of your 7''s.  This shot brought back those memories of staring at the Christmas tree partially cross-eyed so that the lights blurred beautifully like this.  Do I sound crazy?  Am I the only one who has ever done that?  If so, I was just kidding....I had a friend who said she did that once...um...yeah that''s it!  :)  Thanks for the nostalgic moment!', '2006-11-22 18:41:26.000000', NULL, 0),
