(3067502, 427306, 22301, '<td valign="top">After looking at the homepage for the last week I enjoy revisiting this one the most, a great natural image.</td>', 'After looking at the homepage for the last week I enjoy revisiting this one the most, a great natural image.', '2006-11-28 01:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067648, 426747, 22301, '<td valign="top">Great shot Deb, I don;t know how I missed seeing this result, it is a truly excellent shot and congrats on your second best score ever!! The only thing I can think of that may have improved the shot would have been a tighter crop to fill the frame with spots. Just a suggestion, truly outstanding!</td>', 'Great shot Deb, I don;t know how I missed seeing this result, it is a truly excellent shot and congrats on your second best score ever!! The only thing I can think of that may have improved the shot would have been a tighter crop to fill the frame with spots. Just a suggestion, truly outstanding!', '2006-11-28 05:13:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067740, 427160, 34192, '<td valign="top">I find this amazingly humorous.  You''ve elevated the kitsch object to one of art.  Typically we see statues, toys, stuffed animals shot with no regard to the rest of the image.  Here, you given it an amazing setting and lighting that gives the object an entire new world with in which to consider it.  Not sure I''m explaining myself well but you''ve given me a view of something not real and made it seem as if it is real - it has a life, it has emotion, it has attitude.  Much like what oyu accomplished on your woody image.  Its funny, if I stare at it long enough, I can see him moving his head aorund to look at me, wondering why I''m there.  Its not an easy task to give life to something so lifeless.  Kudos on an excellent job.</td>', 'I find this amazingly humorous.  You''ve elevated the kitsch object to one of art.  Typically we see statues, toys, stuffed animals shot with no regard to the rest of the image.  Here, you given it an amazing setting and lighting that gives the object an entire new world with in which to consider it.  Not sure I''m explaining myself well but you''ve given me a view of something not real and made it seem as if it is real - it has a life, it has emotion, it has attitude.  Much like what oyu accomplished on your woody image.  Its funny, if I stare at it long enough, I can see him moving his head aorund to look at me, wondering why I''m there.  Its not an easy task to give life to something so lifeless.  Kudos on an excellent job.', '2006-11-28 07:12:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067885, 427306, 44490, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Jeni!  Wonderful shot, expression, makes us smile with you.</td>', 'Congratulations Jeni!  Wonderful shot, expression, makes us smile with you.', '2006-11-28 09:05:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(3067968, 427154, 66569, '<td valign="top">Way to go!<br/>I think your image would have fit in on the first page!</td>', 'Way to go!I think your image would have fit in on the first page!', '2006-11-28 10:11:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3068339, 425931, 2784, '<td valign="top">great calves!</td>', 'great calves!', '2006-11-28 13:24:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069150, 427548, 60173, '<td valign="top">I played with this image a little bit in photoshop and tried that tutorial that idnic posted about pimping eyes. I think it''s the slightly grey eyes that caused people to vote this image down. I know this was a basic challenge and you couldn''t have fixed the eyes by dodging and burning, but you should try it out just for fun. The image looks great with the bright clear eyes.</td>', 'I played with this image a little bit in photoshop and tried that tutorial that idnic posted about pimping eyes. I think it''s the slightly grey eyes that caused people to vote this image down. I know this was a basic challenge and you couldn''t have fixed the eyes by dodging and burning, but you should try it out just for fun. The image looks great with the bright clear eyes.', '2006-11-28 20:02:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3069322, 427548, 55199, '<td valign="top">aliqui:  Thanks for the suggestion; I haven''t played with it, but I know that this would have been far far better if I could have used advanced editing.  Also, I forgot to set my white balance correctly on my camera so the quality is diminished some because of the tweaking I had to do to correct it.</td>', 'aliqui:  Thanks for the suggestion; I haven''t played with it, but I know that this would have been far far better if I could have used advanced editing.  Also, I forgot to set my white balance correctly on my camera so the quality is diminished some because of the tweaking I had to do to correct it.', '2006-11-28 21:38:56.000000', NULL, 0),
